{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/collectionofone\/partition(by:)-2ouy4"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"partition","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"by","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"belongsInSecondPartition","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/MutableCollection\/Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:SM7ElementQa","text":"Element"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rethrows","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SM5IndexQa","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/MutableCollection\/Index","text":"Index","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"belongsInSecondPartition","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A predicate used to partition"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the collection. All elements satisfying this predicate are ordered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"after all elements not satisfying it."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The index of the first element in the reordered collection"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that matches "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"belongsInSecondPartition"},{"type":"text","text":". If no elements in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"collection match "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"belongsInSecondPartition"},{"type":"text","text":", the returned index is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"equal to the collection’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"endIndex"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After partitioning a collection, there is a pivot index "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"p"},{"type":"text","text":" where"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no element before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"p"},{"type":"text","text":" satisfies the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"belongsInSecondPartition"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"predicate and every element at or after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"p"},{"type":"text","text":" satisfies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"belongsInSecondPartition"},{"type":"text","text":". This operation isn’t guaranteed to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stable, so the relative ordering of elements within the partitions might"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In the following example, an array of numbers is partitioned by a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"predicate that matches elements greater than 30."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var numbers = [30, 40, 20, 30, 30, 60, 10]","let p = numbers.partition(by: { $0 > 30 })","\/\/ p == 5","\/\/ numbers == [30, 10, 20, 30, 30, 60, 40]"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"numbers"},{"type":"text","text":" array is now arranged in two partitions. The first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"partition, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"numbers[..<p]"},{"type":"text","text":", is made up of the elements that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are not greater than 30. The second partition, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"numbers[p...]"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is made up of the elements that "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"are"}]},{"type":"text","text":" greater than 30."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let first = numbers[..<p]","\/\/ first == [30, 10, 20, 30, 30]","let second = numbers[p...]","\/\/ second == [60, 40]"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note that the order of elements in both partitions changed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"That is, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"40"},{"type":"text","text":" appears before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"60"},{"type":"text","text":" in the original collection,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"but, after calling "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"partition(by:)"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"60"},{"type":"text","text":" appears before "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"40"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":"), where "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is the length of the collection."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Complexity"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/CollectionOfOne\/partition(by:)-2ouy4","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/CollectionOfOne"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reorders the elements